Hand written, applies after the generated rename. Upstream keeps empty placeholder directories with files
that the repository's own ignore rules (logs/, and a work/.gitignore that ignores everything including itself)
would silently leave out of a commit; a vendored tree that differs from what is committed fails
mender-sync.sh --verify on a fresh clone. The build script creates these directories.

